    "minides": "Between the A5 and RS5 — 349 bhp, quattro AWD, and five doors of understated performance luxury.",
    "description": "The Audi S5 Sportback (B9.5) is sold in India as a CBU import in two variants — the standard 3.0 TFSI Quattro and the Platinum Edition. Powered by a 2.9-litre biturbo V6 TFSI producing 349 bhp at 5,400 rpm and 500 Nm from 1,370–4,500 rpm, paired with an 8-speed tiptronic and quattro AWD with sport differential. The S5 Sportback sprints from 0–100 km/h in 4.9 seconds and is electronically limited to 250 km/h. All variants include Virtual Cockpit, 10.1-inch MMI Touch, panoramic sunroof, three-zone climate control, S sport seats, and Bang & Olufsen audio. The Platinum Edition adds Matrix LED headlamps with laser light, red brake calipers, black/carbon exterior accents, and distinctive styling upgrades. Prices were reduced under India's GST 2.0 framework in September 2025."
  },
